{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36967","headline":"西川与蔡十九同别子超 · 罗隐","name":"西川与蔡十九同别子超","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相欢虽则不多时，相别那能不歛眉。\n蜀客赋高君解爱，楚宫腰细我还知。\n百年恩爱无终始，万里因缘有梦思。\n肠断门前旧行处，不堪全属五陵儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}